      ],
      "source": "https://taylorsfallsmn.gov/our-community/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The city’s name honors Jesse Taylor, a territorial politician who was among its earliest settlers.",
